	<h2>ChatGPT</h2>
			<p1>
				OpenAI was founded by Sam Altman, Elon Musk, and Peter Thiel in 2015.
				ChatGPT was developed by OpenAI and first released to the public in 
				November of 2022. ChatGPT is a generative AI chatbot that is a multimodal
				that handles text, audio, and images. It takes user inputs to create 
				desired outputs using a two-stage process. The input is Language Understanding,
				which converts user input into numerical representations. The output is 
				Response Generation, which predicts the next best response based on patterns 
				learned during training. The training method used by ChatGpt is Reinforcement 
				Learning from Human Feedback. This type of learning uses human feedback received 
				when users rate the responses. Due to the use of this training method ChatGPT
				recognizes patterns so it does not always output facts. When this occurs it 
				is called a hallucination and the AI confidently states false information. 
				Despite this ChatGPT is definitely the one of front runners in AI, offering 
				a plethora of different models that are up to par or better than it's competitors
				products. For example Codex is considered one of the best coding assitants in the 
				whole industry producing results that are blowing people away. 
			</p1>
